; qlfile -- qlot dependency manifest for sext
; Run: qlot install
;
; Resolved by direct verification (clone + ASDF load against a real SBCL +
; Quicklisp install) -- see CLAUDE.md, "Issue #3 resolution" for the full
; evidence trail. Summary:
;   - concrete-syntax-tree, eclector(-concrete-syntax-tree), khazern*,
;     com.inuoe.jzon, fiveam, closer-mop, 40ants-doc, 40ants-ci: all
;     present in the default Quicklisp dist as of dist 2026-01-01. No
;     Ultralisp needed for any of these.
;   - cleavir-ctype (the AST converter's type-representation protocol)
;     ships its own complete default implementation as part of Cleavir
;     itself (Ctype/default.lisp, unconditionally loaded) -- no separate
;     `ctype`/`ctype/tfun` library dependency needed. An earlier version
;     of this manifest listed `ctype`/`ctype/tfun` on the mistaken
;     assumption that Cleavir's own Example/ frontend's choice of backend
;     was required; see CLAUDE.md, "Issue #5 notes" for the full story.
;   - trivial-json-codec/shasht (a CLOS-aware JSON encoding layer) are
;     NOT needed either, for the same class of reason: Cleavir already
;     ships its own canonical "what's interesting about this AST node"
;     protocol, CLEAVIR-IO:SAVE-INFO, which sext's walker (src/walker.lisp)
;     uses directly to fully flatten AST objects to plain data before
;     any JSON library sees them -- so only a thin plain-data JSON writer
;     is needed, and com.inuoe.jzon already covers that. See
;     src/walker.lisp's file header for the full evidence trail.
;   - Cleavir (cleavir-cst-to-ast, cleavir-ast, and the rest of the
;     cleavir-* family) is NOT in Quicklisp or Ultralisp (verified: zero
;     matches in either dist's systems.txt/releases.txt). It ships only
;     as a single monorepo at the URL below; every cleavir-*.asd file
;     lives in its own subdirectory, so the registry needs each
;     subdirectory pushed, not just the repo root.

ql fiveam
ql com.inuoe.jzon
ql concrete-syntax-tree
ql eclector
ql eclector-concrete-syntax-tree
ql khazern
ql khazern-extrinsic

git cleavir https://github.com/s-expressionists/Cleavir.git

ultralisp 40ants-doc
